WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.800
A row running for twenty minutes.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.100
Dead worker, or just a slow one?

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.100
Status says running for both.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.400
The guard authorised a situation.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.700
Two reports. One reader. No log.

6
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.500
So give the claim a name.

7
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.800
A number identifies the attempt.

8
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.300
Every write quotes it.

9
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.300
Twice we watched for an edge.

10
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.100
It fell between two polls.

11
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:35.400
Send the value. Let them compare.

12
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.800
Only a reader knows what it holds.

13
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.000
Eight ways wrong. Eight caught.

14
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.500
Name the claim, not the state.
